ric Ries, <a href="https://theleanstartup.com/principles" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Lean Startup Methodology</a>. <a href="#r8" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li><li id="ref-9">GitHub Docs, <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/using-github/github-flow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub flow</a>. <a href="#r9" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li><li id="ref-10">DORA, <a href="https://dora.dev/capabilities/trunk-based-development/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Trunk-based development</a>. <a href="#r10" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li><li id="ref-11">NIST, <a href="https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/final" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Secure Software Development Framework, SP 800-218</a>. <a href="#r11" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li><li id="ref-12">Microsoft Research, <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/articles/patterns-of-trustworthy-experimentation-during-experiment-stage/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patterns of Trustworthy Experimentation</a>. <a href="#r12" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li><li id="ref-13">DORA, <a href="https://dora.dev/research/2025/dora-report/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">State of AI-assisted Software Development</a>, 2025. <a href="#r13" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li><li id="ref-14">Google Search Central, <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/using-gen-ai-content?hl=es-419" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Guía sobre el uso de IA generativa en sitios web</a>. <a href="#r14" aria-label="Volver al texto">↩</a></li></ol></div></section>
